      value: Explaining confidentiality is crucial to build trust, protect client
        privacy and is our legal and ethical obligation. This needs to happen early
        during initial meeting.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7933084111462251496, guid: f534253c77d7d414db6e9865d1761ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8367643867128324293, guid: f534253c77d7d414db6e9865d1761ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextModRef
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1666936501}
    - target: {fileID: 8367643867128324293, guid: f534253c77d7d414db6e9865d1761ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introductionMessage
      value: "In these VR simulations, you will step into the role of a social worker
        meeting a new client for the very first time. Before you begin, ensure you
        have reviewed the course material on the Beginning Phase & Exploration Phase
        of the Helping Process.\n\r\nIn these Modules, you are a social worker, working
        at an inner city agency supporting participants with a range of needs including
        basic needs, housing and mental health.\r\nThroughout the simulation, you\u2019ll
        see several response options reflecting choices new practitioners often make.
        Some show common missteps that can affect client safety or consent, while
        others model best practice aligned with ethical and professional standards.\r\n\r\nWhen
        you\u2019re ready, begin the interaction and choose your next step in responding
        to your client."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8713139196572598547, guid: f534253c77d7d414db6e9865d1761ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: videoMaterial
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 8c4ca057f504a4241bceee60e6a16b00, type: 2}
